OL,3,GNEWSAJewish community in harder
OL,4,Aposition than immediately after
OL,5,Asynagogue attack, says rabbi
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Jewish community at a synagogue
OL,8,Fwhere two men were killed in 2025 feels
OL,9,Fless safe now than it did immediately
OL,10,Fafter the attack, its rabbi has said
OL,11,Falmost one year on.
OL,13,FRabbi Daniel Walker said rising
OL,14,Fantisemitism, combined with a lack of
OL,15,Faction to "deal with core problems",
OL,16,Fhad left many members of Heaton Park
OL,17,FHebrew Congregation in Manchester ` and
OL,18,FBritish Jews more widely ` feeling
OL,19,Fincreasingly vulnerable as the
OL,20,Fanniversary of the attack approaches.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
